  ],
  "breadcrumbs": [],
  "keywords": [],
  "ingredients": [
    "6 small russet potatoes, scrubbed",
    "1 tablespoon olive oil, or as needed",
    "1 tablespoon canola oil, or as needed",
    "salt to taste",
    "6 slices center-cut bacon",
    "ground black pepper to taste",
    "0.5 cup shredded Cheddar cheese, or to taste",
    "0.25 cup sour cream, or to taste",
    "2 medium green onions, thinly sliced"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ow7vrMYoOaNTPHiNsO3gRAhsSV4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-282216-homemade-potato-skins-VAT-step-01-c3dc621fa9b54f9f9de5f13c96b6deba.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/282216/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rub potatoes with olive oil and place on a baking sheet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lYKsLBxbp0ZHbv-rR2cxlYERtOw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-282216-homemade-potato-skins-VAT-step-02-cb407794bc1d47638f38348b8bce845b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/282216/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until tender, about 1 hour. Remove from the oven and let sit until cool enough to handle, about 10 minutes. Increase the oven temperature to 450 degrees F (230 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/u7lJAtGMUP8G3DxeTrWaefJeRYc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-282216-homemade-potato-skins-VAT-step-03-4fdbcbd2d91d4ddcbdbf07bb44818362.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/282216/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut potatoes in half lengthwise. Scoop out flesh, leaving 1/4 inch on the skin. Brush canola oil all over potato skins, outside and inside, then sprinkle with salt. Reserve flesh for another use.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/V4jt8DY7SYP3oG5H0P_7rjN5_Z0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-282216-homemade-potato-skins-VAT-step-04-0a7adc2b0fee40a0960d7d7553c47853.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/282216/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake skins in the preheated oven for 10 minutes. Flip and continue baking for 10 minutes more. Remove from the oven and turn on the oven's broiler.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MreSlh8go26oMt0gkdRRy9z_Lyg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-282216-homemade-potato-skins-VAT-step-05-b295419c70f94efabce350fc74052884.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/282216/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, cook bacon in a large skillet over medium-high heat, turning occasionally, until evenly browned, about 10 minutes. Drain bacon on a paper towel-lined plate; crumble.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lXODGb23nNh9ga811XN-mlY3KUo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-282216-homemade-potato-skins-VAT-step-06-3drainingonpaper-cb14dd7a089a40c8861bfa3ba543bee9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/282216/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Arrange potato skins flesh-side up on a roasting pan or rack; season flesh with black pepper. Sprinkle with Cheddar cheese and crumbled bacon. Cook under the preheated broiler until cheese is bubbly, about 2 minutes. Remove from the oven.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Kz0mzjIGEA5ERdcCWOVHMpjSqiI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-282216-homemade-potato-skins-VAT-step-07-4fee3480c958474b9e165043374eb071.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/282216/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add a dollop of sour cream to each skin and sprinkle with green onions to serve.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VQJxpy-HRGIo6RJh9B_aB_3BWDQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-282216-homemade-potato-skins-VAT-step-08-e705b0b8f8574ff287e154b728d85761.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/282216/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
